id: pm-blvfye
title: "GH-1118: natural-language word-number titles trigger duplicate issue-code false positives"
description: "The duplicate issue-code title heuristic treats prose such as Match-3, Covid-19, or Wi-Fi-6 as tracker identifiers and emits an impossible rename-or-merge remediation for unrelated items."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:governance","area:validate",false-positive,github-intake
created_at: "2026-08-25T16:27:05.142Z"
